a6ae279\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ed75d2b elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"ed75d2b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2>What Happens Next</h2><p>Three steps, no surprises, no obligation at any point.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-cc66891 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"cc66891\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9ef1d1e elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"9ef1d1e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"eb\">Within 1 business day</span><h3>1. We review your website</h3><p>A specialist looks at your site the way Google and AI assistants see it: indexing and crawl health, speed and Core Web Vitals, security, your Google Business Profile, and the searches you should be winning.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-de51bd9 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"de51bd9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"eb\">Your copy to keep</span><h3>2. You get the findings in writing</h3><p>A plain-English summary of what is working, what is broken, and what to fix first, ranked by impact. It is written for a business owner, not for an SEO. You keep it whether or not you work with us.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1d4a130 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"1d4a130\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"eb\">No pressure</span><h3>3. We talk it through, only if you want</h3><p>A short call to walk through the findings and answer questions. If a project makes sense we will quote it; if it does not, we will tell you that too.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f178fc3 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"f178fc3\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7b8ec44 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"7b8ec44\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-459ef60 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"459ef60\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2>What We Check in Your Free Audit</h2><p>The four areas that decide whether customers find you and whether that visibility turns into calls.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-94a7302 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"94a7302\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c1162e3 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"c1162e3\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Google Search</h3><p>Current organic visibility, the searches you rank for and the ones you should, technical SEO health, and content gaps by service.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b23705c elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"b23705c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Google Maps</h3><p>Google Business Profile completeness, categories, duplicate or conflicting listings, reviews, and local visibility against nearby competitors.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-01a0f4e elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"01a0f4e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Your Website</h3><p>Speed and Core Web Vitals, mobile experience, security state, structured data, internal linking, and whether your forms and calls actually work.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-95a60c7 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"95a60c7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>AI Search</h3><p>What ChatGPT, Gemini, Google AI Overviews, and Copilot currently say about your business, and the entity and answer gaps behind it.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ad1cdf1 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"ad1cdf1\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-647da67 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"647da67\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-42a564c e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"42a564c\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2e56a59 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"2e56a59\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-736c8c2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"736c8c2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2>While You Wait</h2><p>A few things worth reading before we speak. They will make the audit findings easier to act on.</p><ul><li><a href=\"/ai-search-optimization/\">AI Search Optimization</a> — how businesses get found by ChatGPT, Gemini, and Google AI</li><li><a href=\"/ai-visibility-audit/\">AI Visibility Audit</a> — what we measure and why rankings alone no longer tell the story</li><li><a href=\"/website-seo-repair-services-in-us/\">SEO repair</a> — the technical problems that quietly hide good content from Google</li><li><a href=\"/website-maintenance-services/\">Website maintenance plans</a> — from $300 a month, so fixes stay fixed</li><li><a href=\"/hacked-website-repair/\">Hacked website repair</a> — if your site is compromised, start here instead and call us</li><li><a href=\"/fix-website-issues-blogs/\">Our blog</a> — practical guides on SEO, AI search, and website performance</li></ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-99468a7 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"99468a7\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5446750 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"5446750\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"eb\">Need us sooner?</span><h3>If your website is down, hacked, or losing money right now</h3><p>Do not wait for the audit. Call us and we will start immediately. Our repair team is on call 24/7.</p><p><strong>Phone:</strong> <a href=\"tel:18322667209\">(832) 266-7209</a><br><strong>Alternate:</strong> <a href=\"tel:18322667209\">(979) 250-7486</a><br><strong>Email:</strong> <a href=\"mailto:info@fixwebsiteissues.com\">info@fixwebsiteissues.com</a></p><p>Fix Website Issues is the technical SEO and website repair division of WevTEC, based in Houston, Texas, serving businesses nationwide since 2013.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-10b1e2e e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"10b1e2e\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;gradient&quot;}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-21d437c e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"21d437c\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-df6d144 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"df6d144\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2>One Last Thing</h2><p>Add info@fixwebsiteissues.com to your contacts so our reply does not land in spam. If you gave us a phone number, keep an eye out for a call from a Houston (832) area code.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7cc4646 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"7cc4646\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2208a61 elementor-widget__width-auto elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"2208a61\" data-element_type=\"widget\"